    "data": [
        {
            "title": "立足股壇｜港股未宜撈底 考慮部署認沽期權｜JK爸爸（陳立展）",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0d3ab388231783f61fe66c5b8fb8dcd07902e17730554a5807a96f5dfe5bf055/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fbossmind_356%2F1a751f705553d9d6ce090a8035b14d1b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">港股連跌三日，進一步跌至22,800點附近，與今年低位相差僅約300點。不過，現時盤路有異，暫時未屆撈底之時。投資者應增強防守，持股票可部署少量的認沽期權（Long Put），對沖潛在下行風險。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">市場在本月初部署的盤路，在過去兩星期逐步抽離，導致現時盤路變得奇異，暫時難言是否已經觸底，故暫應一動不如一靜，並先加強投資組合的防守力。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">騰訊（700）季績令市場失望，周四急挫6.5%，為拖累大市元兇。然而，中長線而言，騰訊現價估值屬便宜，但短期的技術面仍然偏弱。持貨的投資者可先作防守性部署，例如部署下月到期，行使價330元的認沽期權，而無須在現時急於拋售離場。阿里（9988）近期受累美國收緊晶片管制的消息，連跌10個交易日。由於走弱仍弱，故不宜撈底，但公司整體質素不俗，持貨者可繼續持有。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>陳立展（JK爸爸</strong>）<br/><strong>獨立股評人</strong><br/><strong>資深期權投資者</strong></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>註：專欄作家言論不代表本網立場</strong></p><a class=\"mb-module-gap\" data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":0,\"yLinkElement\":\"img\"}' data-ylk=\"elm:img;elmt:link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://signup.hkiei.com/jksir_seminar_bossmind\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/a8e63c9c5d51a8d9bb64efdadede23a5dbd34662fb0913177013510994935812/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fbossmind_356%2F02558232bd3a1f5108de0237d78fb483.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></div></a></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E7%AB%8B%E8%B6%B3%E8%82%A1%E5%A3%87-%E6%B8%AF%E8%82%A1%E6%9C%AA%E5%AE%9C%E6%92%88%E5%BA%95-%E8%80%83%E6%85%AE%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E8%AA%8D%E6%B2%BD%E6%9C%9F%E6%AC%8A-jk%E7%88%B8%E7%88%B8-%E9%99%B3%E7%AB%8B%E5%B1%95-110000695.html",
